# Files that run on the Linux VM must keep LF endings regardless of the
# committer's core.autocrlf setting. CRLF would break the shell script
# (bad interpreter) and the Caddy/Docker configs.
*.sh        text eol=lf
Caddyfile   text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
.env*       text eol=lf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What ships to the production VM.
#
# scripts/deploy-vm.sh delivers a release by inlining `git archive HEAD` into an
# Azure run-command payload, which has a hard size ceiling (~256 KB; the script
# guards at 200 KB). Adding the blog tipped the repo over it, and the failure
# mode is a refused deploy rather than a degraded one.
#
# `git archive` honours export-ignore, so listing a path here keeps it out of the
# release tarball and changes nothing else. The rule is simply: if
# `docker compose build` does not read it, the VM does not need it.
#
#   docs/       reference material, read on GitHub
#   .github/    workflows run on the runner, never on the VM
#   scripts/    deploy-vm.sh runs from the operator's machine or CI, not the VM
#   *.md        READMEs and plans; nothing at runtime parses markdown
#   geneav.sh / geneav.ps1            local docker-stack helpers
#   geneav.postman_collection.json    published to users, not used by the stack
#   .env.prod.example                 template; the real .env.prod lives on the VM
#
# NOTICE is deliberately NOT excluded: it carries the ClamAV/GPL attribution and
# should travel with any deployed copy of the software.
#
# Effect: 182 KB -> 126 KB gzipped, 244 KB -> 168 KB base64-inlined. This buys
# headroom, it does not remove the ceiling — when the archive nears 200 KB again
# the answer is a container registry, as deploy-vm.sh already says.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/                           export-ignore
.github/                        export-ignore
scripts/                        export-ignore
*.md                            export-ignore
geneav.sh                       export-ignore
geneav.ps1                      export-ignore
geneav.postman_collection.json  export-ignore
.env.prod.example               export-ignore
.gitattributes                  export-ignore
